	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "8-position 2.54 mm rising-clamp screw terminal on 1.1 mm holes, made to fit both On Shore and Phoenix (Andy, 2026-11-11). Fits: On Shore OSTVN08A150; Amphenol Anytek VN08A1500000G (the original of the On Shore design); GCT TBC05-08-1-G-G; Phoenix Contact MPT 0,5/8-2,54. Pins: On Shore/Anytek/GCT 0.90 x 0.40 mm, Phoenix 0.9 x 0.5 mm; 1.1 mm is Phoenix's recommended hole. Pads, silkscreen and pin row as 1X08_SCREW (1.016 mm holes, On Shore only). Wire entry at -y. Body envelope: On Shore 6.5 mm deep (pin row 3.3 mm from the entry face), Phoenix 6.2 mm centered.")
	(tags "terminal block screw 2.54 rising clamp On Shore OSTVN Anytek VN GCT TBC05 Phoenix MPT")
